{
  "item": "QueenRainer01",
  "mu_name": "Queen Rainer",
  "mu_name_from": "MuMain _enum.h MONSTER_QUEEN_RAINER (70), drawn as MONSTER_MODEL_QUEEN_RAINER = 51 (_enum.h:4201), so Monster52.bmd. OpenMU Version095d Maps/Icarus.cs:160 names breed 70 'Queen Rainer'. docs/icarus-port.md.",
  "world": "icarus",
  "object_type": 70,
  "monster": {
    "model_index": 51,
    "scale": 1.3
  },
  "monster_from": "ZzzCharacter.cpp:13579-13586, CreateMonster, case MONSTER_QUEEN_RAINER: Scale = 1.3f; BlendMesh = -2 at BlendMeshLight 1; m_bRenderShadow = false. Its effects, in game/play (kQueenRainerFigure): a white BITMAP_LIGHT at Scale 0.8 on bone 20, Bip01 Head (:8815-8818), as an Alquamos's starlight; MoveCharacterVisual's BITMAP_JOINT_THUNDER sub 7 along fourteen bone pairs every frame (:5768-5817), ours a few a reference frame (kQueenArcs); and her blow's twenty BITMAP_BLIZZARD falling on the target at the attack's fifth key (:1681-1695; ShadowStars::blizzard), without their BITMAP_FIRE + 2 trails.",
  "profile": "monster",
  "rig_from": "Exported with --actions=all, 7 actions, 57 bones; keys 6, 6, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7. Its death plays at 0.22 (ZzzOpenData.cpp:3761-3767), in actions.json's action_overrides.",
  "sheets": {
    "kuo00": "rainer_kuo00.png",
    "kuo01": "rainer_kuo01.png",
    "kuo02": "rainer_kuo02.png"
  },
  "sheet_from": "Data/Monster's kuo00.OZJ (256 square, her violet star-field gown, 117 triangles), kuo01.OZJ (64x128, the violet wings, 228) and kuo02.OZJ (128x256, her body, hair and face in violet bands, 574), under a rainer_ prefix.",
  "sheet_materials": {
    "kuo00": "cloth",
    "kuo01": "leather",
    "kuo02": "skin"
  },
  "sheet_materials_from": "Every mesh is a glow, so these only name them: the gown, the wings' membrane, the body.",
