  },
  "glow_from": "BlendMesh -2: RenderMesh adds every mesh (`blendMeshIndex <= -2`, ZzzBMD.cpp:1509-1516), so the whole Queen is violet light on the dark; and m_bRenderShadow = false, so she casts none. And her gown, mesh 1 (kuo00), at half: RenderObject's MODEL_QUEEN_RAINER arm draws the body with mesh 1 hidden, then mesh 1 alone at 0.5 with RENDER_WAVE (ZzzObject.cpp:1372-1376) -- ours its glow held at 0.5 (`pulse` [0, 0.5]); the wave's ripple is left out.",
  "sounds_from": "ZzzOpenData.cpp:3761-3767: SetMonsterSound(..., 171, -1, 172, 172, 173): mRainner1 to move, mRainnerAttack1 to attack, mRainnerDie to die. Wired as queenrainer_* in sounds.json.",
